---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About BREATH" description="About BREATH, a health knowledge platform about breathing, sleep and wellbeing.">
  <article class="prose">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the platform</p>
    <h1>Curiosity, clarity and better health.</h1>
    <p class="standfirst">BREATH explores the science of breathing, sleep and wellbeing — translating complex health topics into clear, thoughtful and useful information.</p>
    <h2>What you’ll find here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Breathing:</strong> respiratory health, physiology and common respiratory conditions.</li>
      <li><strong>Sleep:</strong> sleep health, sleep apnoea and treatment insights.</li>
      <li><strong>Mindfulness:</strong> awareness, stress and mind–body wellbeing.</li>
      <li><strong>Research:</strong> medical evidence and critical perspectives on health studies.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Our approach</h2>
    <p>Content aims to be evidence-informed, transparent about uncertainty and accessible to a broad audience. References should be provided where appropriate.</p>
    <p><em>Author biography can be added here when you are ready to publish it.</em></p>
    <h2>Medical disclaimer</h2>
    <p>BREATH provides general educational information only. It is not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis or treatment. Readers should seek advice from an appropriately qualified health professional for their individual circumstances.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.standfirst{font-size:1.15rem;color:#65736d!important}</style>